* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
# Generated bundles (npm run build): never diffed as text, never merged line by line. A conflict keeps
# one side whole and the steward rebuilds the bundle from its sources (V5.4 plan, section 2.2).
static/css/dist/** -diff merge=binary
static/js/dist/** -diff merge=binary
